    "Project B": {
      "Clarity of Value Proposition": "• Very clear. The problem of mouse strain and the solution of a gesture-based input ring are easily understood.",
      "Market Size and Demand": "• Large and diverse – appeals to a broad range of users with common needs. The cross-platform compatibility is a significant advantage.",
      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• Strong.  Having completed hardware development, prototypes, and initial production runs demonstrates significant progress. The milestone-driven roadmap is well-defined.",
      "Revenue Model and Sustainability": "• Clear – a straightforward hardware sales model with optional software upgrades. The inclusion of a warranty and environmental considerations adds value.",
